  {
    "id": 2011011010050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "飛行機の時間って、何すればいいんだ……？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101101/2011011010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011010060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "到着後のスケジュールも頭に入ってるし、\r\n仕事の確認──はもう充分やってきたし……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101101/2011011010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011010070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "なんつーか……アタシだけで地方の仕事とか、\r\nひとりで飛行機とかもあんまないからさ",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101101/2011011010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011010080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "や、プロデューサーもいるけど\r\nアンタは仕事があるだろ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101101/2011011010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あ、すまん。パソコン、しまうよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011010090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "いやいや、別にいーって！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101101/2011011010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011010100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……だから、\r\nひとりで時間潰せる方法、ないかなって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201101101/2011011010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、そういうことなら……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "音楽を聴くのはどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "お菓子を食べるとか",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "寝ておくのも手だぞ",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011011010110,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え？\r\n結構ゴーって鳴ってるけど……",
